<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Futuro antico</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1996</span><span class="sg-chain-h">Angelo Branduardi recorded &quot;Los set goyts&quot; and &quot;Imperayritz de la ciutat joyosa&quot; on the album</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Lord of the Flies (film score by Philippe Sarde)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1990</span><span class="sg-chain-h">melodies of &quot;Stella Splendens&quot;, &quot;Los Set Gotxs&quot; and &quot;Mariam Matrem&quot; used, uncredited, in original orchestrations</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Llibre Vermell de Montserrat: A fourteenth century pilgrimage (Hespèrion XX, Jordi Savall)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1979</span><span class="sg-chain-h">recording</span></li></ul></section>
